# Formspree form endpoint (https://formspree.io/f/xxxx).
#
# Dashboard setup (do this in Formspree, not in client code):
# 1. Create a form whose primary destination is the gift recipient.
# 2. Add a second notification / BCC for yourself in the Formspree dashboard
#    (never put BCC addresses in the frontend — they ship in the JS bundle).
# 3. Paste the form URL below for local builds.
#
# On the host (Vercel/Netlify/…), set the same name as a build-time env var.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxx
